Following the recent Production observations, I think we need to review how our current BICoE deduplication handles a couple of scenarios. Gaurav's current cleanup activity helps address the existing data, but these appear to be ongoing patterns, so we need to understand how they are flowing through the BICoE process and whether we need a continuous handling mechanism in Silver.
